{"id":"3309953c0aaa03b2","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-omega-stability-total-transcendence.md","title":"ω-Stability Implies Total Transcendence","display":"thm-omega-stability-total-transcendence — ω-Stability Implies Total Transcendence","type":"theorem","metadata":{"numbering_status":"local atom identifier; not the book result number","source_section":"7.1","source_result":"Theorem 7.1.22(i), forward implication","source_pages_print":"500–501","source_pages_djvu":"516–517","source_verification":"OCR checked for the stated source and scope; mathematical translation reviewed","type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-omega-stability-total-transcendence","aliases":["17-thm-omega-stability-total-transcendence"],"display":"thm-omega-stability-total-transcendence — ω-Stability Implies Total Transcendence","depends_on":["[[17-df-omega-stability]]","[[17-df-total-transcendence]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-thm-7.2.2","local_revision":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"numbering_status","html":"local atom identifier; not the book result number"},{"key":"source_section","html":"7.1"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Theorem 7.1.22(i), forward implication"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"500–501"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"516–517"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"OCR checked for the stated source and scope; mathematical translation reviewed"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-omega-stability-total-transcendence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-omega-stability-total-transcendence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-omega-stability-total-transcendence — ω-Stability Implies Total Transcendence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0626faf5263e31f8\" href=\"?note=0626faf5263e31f8\" title=\"17-df-omega-stability\">17-df-omega-stability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a2084db1d8bf7af0\" href=\"?note=a2084db1d8bf7af0\" title=\"17-df-total-transcendence\">17-df-total-transcendence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-7.2.2"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OmegaStable}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{OmegaStable}_L\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-stability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0626faf5263e31f8\" href=\"?note=0626faf5263e31f8\" title=\"17-df-omega-stability\">17-df-omega-stability</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TotallyTranscendental}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{TotallyTranscendental}_L\\)</span> (total-transcendence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a2084db1d8bf7af0\" href=\"?note=a2084db1d8bf7af0\" title=\"17-df-total-transcendence\">17-df-total-transcendence</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OmegaStable}_L(T)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{TotallyTranscendental}_L(T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{OmegaStable}_L(T)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{TotallyTranscendental}_L(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>In the countable complete setting, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-stability forces every consistent formula to have ordinal-valued Morley rank. The recursive clauses defining rank remain in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c8c9b6ed48fe2f37\" href=\"?note=c8c9b6ed48fe2f37\" title=\"17-df-unary-morley-rank\">17-df-unary-morley-rank</a> rather than being duplicated here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-omega-stability","status":"resolved","id":"0626faf5263e31f8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-omega-stability]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-total-transcendence","status":"resolved","id":"a2084db1d8bf7af0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-total-transcendence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-omega-stability","status":"resolved","id":"0626faf5263e31f8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{OmegaStable}_L$ ($\\omega$-stability predicate, see [[17-df-omega-stability]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-total-transcendence","status":"resolved","id":"a2084db1d8bf7af0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TotallyTranscendental}_L$ (total-transcendence predicate, see [[17-df-total-transcendence]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-unary-morley-rank","status":"resolved","id":"c8c9b6ed48fe2f37","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"In the countable complete setting, $\\omega$-stability forces every consistent formula to have ordinal-valued Morley rank. The recursive clauses defining rank remain in [[17-df-unary-morley-rank]] rather than being duplicated here.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OmegaStable}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TotallyTranscendental}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OmegaStable}_L(T)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{TotallyTranscendental}_L(T).","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1588,"backlinks":[{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-204","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-thm-aleph-one-categoricity-consequences]]\n[[17-thm-atomic-model-existence]]\n[[17-thm-beth-definability]]\n[[17-thm-beth-definability-satisfaction-form]]\n[[17-thm-chain-sentence-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-chain-theory-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-compactness]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-equivalents]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-henkin-form]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-ultraproduct-form]]\n[[17-thm-completeness-characterization]]\n[[17-thm-countable-back-and-forth]]\n[[17-thm-countable-omitting-types]]\n[[17-thm-craig-interpolation]]\n[[17-thm-craig-interpolation-common-language]]\n[[17-thm-dense-linear-order-qe]]\n[[17-thm-diagram-embedding]]\n[[17-thm-downward-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-thm-ehrenfeucht-mostowski]]\n[[17-thm-elementary-amalgamation]]\n[[17-thm-elementary-chain-union]]\n[[17-thm-elementary-diagram-embedding]]\n[[17-thm-erdos-rado]]\n[[17-thm-existential-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-extended-omitting-types]]\n[[17-thm-finite-ramsey]]\n[[17-thm-fraisse-limit]]\n[[17-thm-horn-axiomatization]]\n[[17-thm-horn-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-horn-sentence-characterization]]\n[[17-thm-horn-sentence-reduced-products]]\n[[17-thm-horn-theory-reduced-products]]\n[[17-thm-isomorphic-ultrapowers]]\n[[17-thm-keisler-shelah]]\n[[17-thm-kei